        }

        ^"Forest Bounder" DEF {
            ^"Description" STRING "The riding deer is a silhouette 3 deer and can be ridden by a human-sized (silhouette 2 or lower) rider. It ignores penalties from dense forested terrain, even when carrying a rider."
        }

        RULES {
            #L5RCW17cc7ce614d0b353ea3792: riding_deer "Riding Deer: Long ago, breeds of deer that are now extremely rare were docile enough for some clans to breed into larger, ridable mounts. Both the Fox and Deer Clans keep small herds of these ridable stags, and while such steeds do not possess the temperament for battle, they are excellent for fast and stealthy travel through thick woods, making them ideal mounts for messengers and spies."
        }
    }

