            ^"Description" STRING "When a riding bear inflicts a critical strike, the TN of the check to resist is 4, and if the target fails the check to resist, the target suffers the Dazed condition in addition to the other effects."
        }

        RULES {
            #L5RCW18cd2e0e5b1ecd24f9734d: riding_bear "Riding Bear: While attempts to domesticate the aggressive brown bears of the Shinomen Forest were extremely ill-fated, especially woodsy shugenja have been known to call upon ursine allies in times of great need, even riding upon the backs of bears when the terrain is especially unfriendly."
        }
    }

