        ^"Cunning Pounce" DEF {
            ^"Description" STRING "A tiger is a silhouette 3 creature with incredible strength but also cunning tactics. When a tiger makes a successful Attack action check against a target, that target must make a TN 4 Tactics check (Air 3, Earth 5) or gain the Disoriented condition."
        }

        ^"Savage Mauling" DEF {
            ^"Description" STRING "Disoriented targets cannot make checks to resist damage dealt by a tiger."
        }

        RULES {
            #L5RCW19a57dcda78795fa016e86: tiger "Tiger: This large, catlike creature tends to be solitary, but it does exhibit social behavior among other tigers. Its fur tends to be an orange shade (or, more rarely, white, yellow, black, or even blue) with vertical black stripes. A dangerous predator, the tiger ranges across an extensive territory, fiercely defending it against other predators. As this beast is associated with nobility, pride, and fierceness, some Ujik, Nehiri, and Suhili families use its image on crests, clothing, and possessions."
        }
    }

