            #L5RCW20a2e584915196da9beb64: ujik_war_pony "Ujik War Pony: The short and stocky pony breeds of the Ujik tribes are famous warrior mounts. Hardy, strong, resistant to illness, and of excellent temperament, these war ponies are prized by the Utaku and Moto to breed with their own warhorses."
        }
