            #L5RCW441b40ccc0082b1c27569d: kaeru_haya "Kaeru Haya: [She/Her] Haya is an old peacekeeper of the Kaeru family of rōnin. She leads the group that manages security along the wharf in the City of the Rich Frog's Unicorn district. Having overseen the comings and goings of Unicorn merchants for quite some time, she has developed an interest in spiritual artifacts from lands beyond Rokugan."
        }
